OL,4,CGovernment's antisemitism adviser      
OL,5,Claunches investigation into BBC        
OL,6,GThe government's antisemitism adviser  
OL,7,Ghas launched an investigation into the 
OL,8,GBBC over allegations of a "hostile     
OL,9,Gwork environment" for Jews.            
OL,11,FLord Mann told BBC Radio 4's Today     
OL,12,Fprogramme he had decided to open the   
OL,13,Finvestigation "because there seems to  
OL,14,Fbe a growing feeling of discomfort     
OL,15,Famong Jewish staff".                   
